<title>USA: AMEX closing averages.</title>
<headline>AMEX closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the American Stock Exchange closed higher in moderate trading.</p>
<p>The Amex index closed at 565.89, up 2.49.</p>
<p>Gainers beat losers 279 to 262.</p>
<p>The average price per share rose $0.06.</p>
<p>Preliminary volume was 18,560,410, compared with 20,424,120 Tuesday.</p>
<p>	   (Prices official as of 1645 EDT/2045 GMT)</p>
